{"name": "Lucky Castaway", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike deckbuilder you are stranded with a slot machine!<br/>Gather resources, craft items and create powerful synergies to survive against all odds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/6492aebca973b0d5f577de19438febb2.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore delightfully odd islands and use the resources you find to craft unique items! <br/>Keep your inventory tidy, because the items you carry form your deck! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"438\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/fa91d5b66f50b45057ae90a7fa11d488.poster.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/fa91d5b66f50b45057ae90a7fa11d488.webm?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/fa91d5b66f50b45057ae90a7fa11d488.mp4?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/a956df451d3505fb27d83bf40b2cd8e6.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build up your camp with different structures (<i>relics</i>) over the course of each run. <br/>Discover new synergies and experiment with different builds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/913b25be5ac1b89284fc511b17849bf5.poster.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/913b25be5ac1b89284fc511b17849bf5.webm?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/913b25be5ac1b89284fc511b17849bf5.mp4?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"104\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/3c911724ab67238ea647572b911615f6.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will encounter a variety of strange creatures on your odyssee and not all of them are friendly!<br/>When you get into trouble, you simply pull the lever of the slot machine.<br/>Your strength and actions in each round of a fight are determined by how your items get arranged.<br/>With good preparation you should be able to survive. Add a bit of luck on top of that and you might become the island's new apex predator!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"218\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/9315e5dd0bd2c1ef6a394076f8b3ba7c.poster.avif?t=1783581866\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/9315e5dd0bd2c1ef6a394076f8b3ba7c.webm?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/9315e5dd0bd2c1ef6a394076f8b3ba7c.mp4?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/fe10046f2f6497fab40a8b8810717d00.poster.avif?t=1783581866\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/extras/fe10046f2f6497fab40a8b8810717d00.webm?t=1783581866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In this roguelike deckbuilder you are stranded with a slot machine! Gather resources, craft items and create powerful synergies to survive against all odds!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4343940/eb979a38551ed816080495bf02252fd190963543/header.jpg?t=1783581866", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelike Deckbuilder", "Crafting", "Roguelite", "Deckbuilding", "Casual"], "developers": "Rare Crab Studio", "publishers": "Rare Crab Studio", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4343940", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "2 July 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/KkIQCA1Qy1E", "first_seen": 1782943200.0, "review_rank": 332}